amux ls — workgroups and agents (state, PRs)

usage: amux ls [--all] [--json]

Each workgroup (its id is its coordinator's) with its agents indented below
it: id, name, harness, state, and open pull requests or review state. Reads
the daemon's canonical state. From inside an agent session the view is scoped
to the session itself (a coordinator also sees its workgroup's current direct
members).

flags:
  -a, --all   also list archived workgroups and agents
  -j, --json  print the raw snapshot (every session field) as JSON

examples:
  amux ls
  amux ls --json
